===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|daschen}}, {{m|enm|dassen}}, from {{der|en|da|daske|t=to slap, strike}}, related to {{cog|sv|daska|t=to smack, slap, spank}}, of obscure origin. Compare {{cog|nds|daaksen|t=to beat}}, {{m+|nds|dösken}}, {{m|nds|döschen}}, {{m|nds|dössen|t=to thrash}}, dialectal {{cog|de|duschen}}, {{m|de|düschen}}, {{m|de|dussen|t=to beat, strike, knock, box}}, {{noncog|ang|dwǣsċan}} {{gl|"to quell, put out, destroy, extinguish"; whence {{m+|en|dush}}}}.

